[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect from \u001b[36mrouting\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[33m  (enter/space to select, esc to go back)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[36m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[36manthropic model on vertex ai provider\u001b[39m\r\n  bedrock provider with apikey\r\n  bedrock provider with credentials\r\n  body routing combined\r\n  body routing embeddings\r\n  body routing regex\r\n  body routing with failover\r\n  gemini model on vertex ai provider\r\n  multi provider groups with priority\r\n  multi provider round robin\r\n  ollama provider\r\n  openai audio stt\r\n  openai audio tts\r\n  openai embeddings provider\r\n  openai multiple endpoints\r\n  openai provider\r\n  query param routing\r\n  sidecar agents\r\n\u001b[2m ────────────────\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[2m← Back\u001b[22m\r\n"]
